<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CommitMate | 새 그룹</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0e0f11;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            --text-muted: #555;
            --danger: #f87171;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
        body {
            background-color: var(--bg); color: #fff;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px; min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column;
        }

        header {
            height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            background: rgba(14,15,17,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        }
        .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; width: 100%; }
        .logo { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; }
        .logo span { color: var(--danger); }

        main { padding: 60px 0; flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; }

        .form-container {
            width: 100%;
            background: #111214;
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px;
        }

        .card-eyebrow { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--danger); margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .card-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .card-sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 32px; }

        .form-group { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .form-label {
            display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
            color: #444; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .form-control {
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 10px; padding: 13px 16px;
            color: #fff; font-size: 14px; transition: 0.2s; outline: none;
        }
        .form-control::placeholder { color: #333; }
        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: rgba(248,113,113,0.4);
            background: rgba(248,113,113,0.04);
        }
        textarea.form-control { resize: none; height: 120px; }

        .divider { border: none; border-top: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); margin: 28px 0 24px; }

        .btn-group { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 10px; }

        .btn-cancel {
            background: transparent;
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            color: #555; padding: 13px; border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;
            text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: 0.2s;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        .btn-cancel:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); color: #aaa; }

        .btn-submit {
            background: var(--danger); color: #fff; border: none;
            padding: 13px; border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-submit:hover { background: #f95e5e; transform: translateY(-2px); }
    </style>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app-theme.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="container">
        <a href="/groups" class="logo">Commit<span>Mate</span>.</a>
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    <div class="container creation-layout">
        <aside class="form-aside group-aside">
            <span class="aside-badge">01 · GROUP</span>
            <h2>같은 목표를 향한<br>첫 공간을 만드세요.</h2>
            <p>그룹을 만든 사람은 총무가 되어 멤버와 미션을 관리할 수 있어요.</p>
            <ul class="aside-checklist">
                <li><i>✓</i><span><strong>가입 코드 자동 생성</strong>친구를 빠르게 초대해요.</span></li>
                <li><i>✓</i><span><strong>그룹별 미션 관리</strong>목표와 일정을 한곳에서 확인해요.</span></li>
                <li><i>✓</i><span><strong>투명한 벌금 정산</strong>모든 멤버가 내역을 함께 확인해요.</span></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="aside-quote">“혼자보다 함께할 때<br>목표는 더 오래 지속돼요.”</div>
        </aside>
        <div class="form-container">
            <p class="card-eyebrow">NEW GROUP</p>
            <h1 class="card-title">새 그룹 개설</h1>
            <p class="card-sub">함께 성장할 팀원들을 위한 공간을 설계하세요.</p>

            <form action="/groups/save" method="post">
                <input type="hidden" name="{{_csrf.parameterName}}" value="{{_csrf.token}}">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="form-label">그룹 이름</label>
                    <input type="text" name="roomName" class="form-control"
                           placeholder="예: 자바 알고리즘 스터디" required maxlength="20">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="form-label">그룹 설명</label>
                    <textarea name="description" class="form-control"
                              placeholder="그룹의 목표나 규칙을 간단히 적어주세요." required></textarea>
                </div>

                <hr class="divider">

                <div class="btn-group">
                    <a href="/groups" class="btn-cancel">취소</a>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">그룹 생성하기</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
